SUMMARY:Animal Tracking Stories: Essex County Environmental Workshop (Ages 5-10)
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, August 5 from 3:00-4:00 PM: Animal Tracking 
 Stories\n\nJoin an Essex County Naturalist to learn about the amazing 
 wonders of nature through stories and activities!\n\nFor ages 
 5-10\n\nRegistration is required and limited to Nutley Public Library 
 cardholders. \n\nSponsored by the Friends of the Nutley Public 
 Library\n\nFor more information\, visit nutleypubliclibrary.org or call the 
 Children's Desk at 973-667-0405 ext. 2623.
LOCATION:Nutley - Stockton Room\, Nutley Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Nutley Library":MAILTO:events@nutley.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Programs (Registration Required), Class
UID:LibCal-10315-16765584
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16765584
END:VEVENT
