SUMMARY:Drop-in Craft (Ages 3 and Up)
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays from 11 AM - 4 PM from July 2 to August 6\n\nDrop-in 
 to the Children's Room each week and work on a unique creation!\n\nJuly 2: 
 Fourth of July Blower\n\nJuly 9: Build a Dinosaur\n\nJuly 16: Pasta 
 Paleontology\n\nJuly 23: Colorful Sea Turtle\n\nJuly 30: Floating Paper 
 Jellyfish\n\nAugust 6: Paper Bead Bracelets\n\nWhile supplies last. \n\nNo 
 registration required. \n\nSuggested for ages 3 and up.\n\nFor more 
 information\, visit nutleypubliclibrary.org or call 973-667-0405 ext. 2623.
LOCATION:Nutley - Children's Room\, Nutley Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Nutley Library":MAILTO:events@nutley.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Programs (No Registration), Craft
UID:LibCal-10315-16765265
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16765265
