SUMMARY:Let's Make - Bath or Body Oil
DESCRIPTION:Let's Make - Bath or Body Oil\nAugust 6\, 2026 at 6:30 PM. 
 Registration required.\n\nPlease note: Registration is limited to adult 
 Nutley cardholders (18 ).\n\nCreate your own custom 3 oz bottle of scented 
 body or bath oil by selecting from nourishing oils\, delightful scents\, 
 and fragrant botanicals to create an oil blend that's uniquely yours. After 
 blending their perfect concoction\, this pampering keepsake can be taken 
 home.\n\nPresented by The Eclectic Chic Boutique.
LOCATION:Nutley - Stockton Room\, Nutley Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Nutley Library":MAILTO:events@nutley.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Craft
UID:LibCal-10315-16870827
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16870827
