SUMMARY:Teen Summer Club (Grades 6-12)
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays at 6:30 PM from July 9 to August 6.\n\nHang out with 
 other teens as we play games and make crafts. \n\nNew activities each week! 
 \n\nSnacks and materials provided. \n\nNo registration required. \n\nFor 
 tweens and teens entering grades 6-12 in Fall 2026. \n\nSponsored by the 
 Friends of the Nutley Public Library. \n\nFor more information\, visit 
 teenservices.nutleypubliclibrary.org or call 973-667-0405 ext. 2623.
