SUMMARY:Postponed - 250 Years of American Music
DESCRIPTION:Program Update: Navesink Brass Band Performance 
 Postponed\n\nThe Navesink Brass Band performance scheduled for Saturday\, 
 August 8\, has been postponed due to medical emergency of one of their 
 members. We send our best wishes to the band and we are looking forward to 
 a new date most likely in September.\n\nThank you all for your 
 understanding. A new performance date will be announced as soon as it is 
 confirmed.
