SUMMARY:Adult Craft -- Rock Painting
DESCRIPTION:\n\nWe'll be using paint pens to decorate smooth rocks with 
 pictures and sayings\, perfect for gifting or sprucing up your garden. 
 \n\nWe will provide patterns to get you started\, or you can use your own 
 inspiration!\n\nRocks are roughly 2-3." All materials are provided.\n\nThis 
 workshop is geared towards adults and teens age 16 .\n\n \n\nOnline 
 registration is required and limited to 25 Nutley teens/adults.  Sponsored 
 by Friends of the Library.\n\n
LOCATION:Nutley - Stockton Room\, Nutley Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Nutley Library":MAILTO:events@nutley.bccls.org
