DTEND:20260926T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260926T000000Z
SUMMARY:Smartphones & Safe Seniors Seminar
DESCRIPTION:We are pleased to welcome Erin Taylor of The Silent Gen LLC for 
 this lecture and Q&A session designed to empower patrons to confidently 
 navigate modern mobile technology.\n\nKey topics include:\n\n\n	Learning to 
 spot warning signs of fraudulent text messsages\n	Tech support for frozen 
 screens and fake virus warning pop-ups\n	Strategies to handle high-pressure 
 imposter calls demanding payment\n\n\nThis lecture is designed to replace 
 vulnerability with practical security\, awareness\, and digital safety 
 strategies.\n\nErin Taylor is a NJ adjunct professor and founder of The 
 Silent Gen LLC\, dedicated to delivering high-impact\, accessible digital 
 literacy and consumer safety education.\n\nRegistration is required and 
 limited to 30 attendees.
LOCATION:Nutley - Stockton Room\, Nutley Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Nutley Library":MAILTO:events@nutley.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Special Event
