SUMMARY:DISH! Cookbook Club
DESCRIPTION:DISH! The Monday Night Cookbook Club is a book club for 
 adults\,18 years and older. Participants will choose\, prepare\, and share 
 a DISH! from a selected cookbook each month. We will then gather to discuss 
 and sample each other’s recipes and share our cooking techniques\, 
 stories\, and culture. \n\nOctober Cookbook Selection: Cooking in Real Life 
 by Lidey Heuck\n\nRegistration is required. Your current Nutley BCCLS Card 
 Account Number is required to register. Once registered\, please borrow the 
 selected Cookbook at the Circulation Desk. \n\nPlease choose your recipe by 
 September 30\, 2026\, and submit the recipe to Michelle at 
 albert@nutley.bccls.org. No duplicate recipes allowed. \n\nSponsored by the 
 Friends of the Nutley Public Library
LOCATION:Nutley - Stockton Room\, Nutley Free Public Library
