BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261027T230000Z
DTEND:20261028T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20261027T000000Z
SUMMARY:Bella Musica: A Salute to Italian American Music
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Italian American Heritage Month with an unforgettable 
 evening of music at the Nutley Public Library as pianist and vocalist Jay 
 Daniels presents Bella Musica: A Salute to Italian American Music.\n\nOn 
 Tuesday\, October 27\, at 7:00PM\, Jay brings to life beloved classics made 
 famous by icons such as Frank Sinatra\, Dean Martin\, Tony Bennett\, Perry 
 Como\, Connie Francis\, Frankie Valli\, Jerry Vale\, and Mario Lanza. 
 Audiences will enjoy timeless favorites including “Come Fly with Me\,” 
 “That’s Amore\,” “Volare\,” “Rags to Riches\,” “Can’t 
 Take My Eyes Off You\,” and many more\, culminating with Sinatra’s 
 signature anthem “My Way.”
LOCATION:Nutley - Children's Room\, Nutley Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Nutley Library":MAILTO:events@nutley.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-10315-16382240
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16382240
