DTEND:20261106T214500Z
DTSTAMP:20261031T000000Z
SUMMARY:Craft Supply Swap Donation Days!
DESCRIPTION:We are collecting your new/like-new/gently-used craft supplies 
 and finding them a new home where they will be used! \n\nDonation Days:  
 \n\n\n	\n	Donate items from Saturday October 31 through Friday November 6 
 only\, during regular library hours.\n	\n	\n	Please limit to 1-2 bags or 
 boxes.\n	\n	\n	Bring to the Reference Desk.\n	\n	\n	If you donate 
 supplies\, you will receive a ticket for admission to the first hour of the 
 swap.\n	\n\n\nGuidelines:\n\n\n	Items should be new or very gently used\, 
 clean and dry\, free from damage and mildew\, in good working 
 condition.\n	Small items (e.g. beads) or sets of items (e.g. markers) 
 should be bagged together.\n	All items should be easily lifted and carried 
 by one person.\n	The library has the right to refuse or recycle 
 items.\n\n\nSuggested Items -- including but not limited to:\n\n\n	\n	beads 
 and jewelry making supplies\n	\n	\n	brushes\, canvases\, unopened 
 paint\n	\n	\n	knitting needles\, crochet hooks\, yarn\n	\n	\n	unopened 
 clay\n	\n	\n	ribbon\, fabric\, trim\, embroidery thread\, 
 needles\n	\n	\n	scrapbook paper\, stickers\, scissors and 
 punches\n	\n	\n	drawing supplies (pencils\, markers)\n	\n	\n	small sewing 
 or craft machines\n	\n	\n	craft kits or supplies for kids\n	\n\n\nYou do 
 not need to be a Nutley cardholder or resident.  Please call 973-667-0405 
 ext. 2604\, or email marisa.treglio@nutley.bccls.org with any questions!
LOCATION:Nutley - Computer Lab
ORGANIZER;CN="Nutley Library":MAILTO:events@nutley.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Special Event
UID:LibCal-10315-17064467
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17064467
END:VEVENT
