SUMMARY:English as a Second Language (ESL) Class
DESCRIPTION:Different levels of English as a Second Language (ESL) classes 
 for adults. \n\nMeetings are Monday\, Tuesday\, and Thursday evenings\, and 
 Saturday mornings\, for a semester of 18 weeks.\n\nInterested students are 
 asked to take a basic placement test\, available at the Reference Desk of 
 the Nutley Public Library.\n\nIf you have questions or need assistance\, 
 please email Anthony Forte\, program instructor\, at: 
 NutleyLibraryESL@outlook.com\n
